          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fear SoF - CT is annoying too</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=33','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Kayel </font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 11/25/2001 10:41:13 PM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF caused some harm to the Plane of Fear in a bit of Old World Smackdown.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">SoF took 3 teams into Fear today to see how we could do.  Needless to say, despite a history of trouble with this plane, SoF rocked the house clearing it all in a little over 4 hours.  Now that we are more familiar with it, expect faster clearings and more loots.  ;)<br><br>Grats out to the following:<br><br>Sigfriend, who scored heavily - grats on his:<br><br>Valorium Bracer X 2<br>Races: DWF ERU HEF HIE HUM - Classes: PAL (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 10 - Wt: 3 - Slot: wrists<br>Attributes: STR+5 DEX+5 MANA+10 SV POISON+5 <br> <br>Valorium Chestplate<br>Races: DWF ERU HEF HIE HUM - Classes: PAL (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 30 - Wt: 7.5 - Slot: chest<br>Attributes: STR+13 STA+9 WIS+9 <br> <br>Valorium Helmet <br>Races: DWF ERU HEF HIE HUM - Classes: PAL (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 17 - Wt: 4.5 - Slot: head<br>Attributes: WIS+7 MANA+15 SV MAGIC+13 <br><br><br><br>Grats out to Nasrim on his:<br><br>Valorium Greaves <br>Races: DWF ERU HEF HIE HUM - Classes: PAL (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 17 - Wt: 5.6 - Slot: legs<br>Attributes: AGI+9 INT+5 SV FIRE+10 <br><br><br><br>Grats to Abai on her:<br><br>Girdle of the Diligent<br>Races: ALL - Classes: CLR (LORE - MAGIC)<br>Stats: AC: 10 - Wt: 0.5 - Slot: waist<br>Attributes: STA+5 WIS+5 <br><br><br> <br>Grats to Kayel on his (banked):<br><br>Shiverback-hide Boots<br>Races: HUM IKS - Classes: MNK (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 6 - Wt: 0.1 - Slot: feet<br>Attributes: STR+5 AGI+9 STA+9 <br><br><br><br>Grats to Xasax on his:<br><br>Shiverback-hide Gloves <br>Races: HUM IKS - Classes: MNK (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 5 - Wt: 0.1 - Slot: hands<br>Attributes: STR+5 DEX+9 INT+5 SV MAGIC+7 <br>Effect: Serpent Sight<br><br><br><br>Grats to Fetri on his:<br><br>Cryosilk Sleeves <br>Races: DEF ERU GNM HIE HUM - Classes: ENC MAG NEC WIZ (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 4 - Wt: 0.4 - Slot: arms<br>Attributes: INT+7 HP+15 SV FIRE+9 <br><br><br> <br>Grats to Genra:<br><br>Fluxbladed Axe <br>Races: ALL - Classes: RNG (LORE - MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: Damage: 7 - Dly: 22 - Wt: 3 - Type: 1hs - Damage Per Second: 6.82<br>Attributes: STR+5 STA+4 <br>Effect: Chaos Flux (150 DD)<br><br>Thorny Vine Boots<br>Races: HEF HUM ELF - Classes: RNG (NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 14 - Wt: 4.9 - Slot: feet<br>Attributes: STR+5 AGI+9 STA+5 SV POISON+7 <br><br><br><br>Grats to Kirrov on his:<br><br>Blighted Skullcap <br>Races: DEF ERU GNM HUM - Classes: NEC (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 5 - Wt: 0 - Slot: head<br>Attributes: INT+8 WIS+7 HP+10 MANA+20 <br><br>Blighted Sleeves <br>Races: DEF ERU GNM HUM - Classes: NEC (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 5 - Wt: 0.4 - Slot: arms<br>Attributes: INT+7 HP+15 SV FIRE+10 <br><br><br><br>Grats to Kanamorm on his:<br><br>Rune Etched Boots <br>Races: BAR OGR TRL - Classes: SHM (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 14 - Wt: 4.9 - Slot: feet<br>Attributes: AGI+9 HP+20 SV COLD+7 <br><br><br> <br>And lastly to Ienamemmmekkjadfeeaf (how DO you spell that anyway) on:<br><br>Carmine Gloves <br>Races: DEF ERU GNM HIE HUM - Classes: WIZ (LORE - MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 4 - Wt: 0.4 - Slot: hands<br>Attributes: DEX+12 INT+7 MANA+15 SV DISEASE+10 <br><br>Carmine Trinket Races: DEF ERU GNM HIE HUM - Classes: WIZ (MAGIC - NO DROP)<br>Stats: AC: 3 - Wt: 0.3 - Slot: wrists<br>Attributes: STR+2 DEX+6 MANA+15 <br><br><br><br>After clearing the plane we made the sordid discovery that, yes, that annoying bellowing was in fact CAZIC THULE.<br><br>Although our brave guildleader Sigurjon offered to root park and epic DoT him to death, we figured that CT was perhaps a bit much for us to handle.  We called on our good friends CoP who wandered in with a few of THEIR friends, and then friends of THOSE friends came, and finally we had a small japanese TV team arrive looking for the Loch Ness monster . . .<br><br>In the end, it was a pleasure watching CoP take out CT - we learned a lot guys.  Grats on the drops - next time we'll bill you for clearing the plane first.  (evil grin)<br><br>And thus ends our broadcast day . . .                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </font>
